Ma teddun akked sin yergazen nniḍen, yal yiwen d asseɣtawal-inu. Ad awiɣ leɣlaḍ n yiwen ad t-nεiceɣ, akked ayen n diri n wayeḍ ad t-ssḥetmeɣ deg-i.
Argaz ur yxemmimen ara ɣef wayen ibɛeden, ad yaf ccwal ɣer wemkan-is.
Ma yekkes urgaz aḥulfu-s ɣef ccbaḥa yerra-t akken s tideţ ɣer cciɛa; ma yexdem i imawlan-is s tezmert-is meṛṛa; ma yefk tudert-is i uzemam-is; ma yella ihedren s tideţ akked imdukal-is - ɣas ma qqaṛen imdanen ur yelmid ara, ad iniɣ s tideţ yelmid.
Ma ur yesɛi ara awal-is ṣeḥḥa, ayen d-yeqqaṛ mačči d ayen ibɣa ad d-yini; ma ayen d-yeqqaṛ mačči d ayen ibɣa, ayen ilaq ad yettwaxdem ad yeqqim mebla axdem; talɣa akked tsenselt ad rẓint; lḥeqq ad yeḍlem, lɣaci ad qqimen deg leεḍer. Daymi ilaq ad yili wawal ṣeḥḥa. Ayagi ihi ameqqran sennig meṛṛa.
